  // Launch reactions (15) keep hand-written rules (no "ops"). Expansion reactions are declarative:
  // each op is interpreted by Battle.ReactionOps.cs (damage/status/apply/field/pull/knock/chain/consume/...).
  // Coverage: every pair of the 12 primary elements is Signature, Generic (named or auto "A·B burst"),
  // Neutral or BlockedByDesign - see Docs/Expansion/ELEMENT_REACTION_MATRIX.md (generated).
  // 15 order-independent element pairs. Reaction damage =
  //   (base * waveLevelScale + attackScale * sourceAttack) * (1 + ReactionBonus + EM bonus + mods) * per-effect mult
  // consume: gauge removed from the existing aura per incoming gauge unit.
  // cooldown: per-target anti-repeat window for this pair (seconds).
